{"3915010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parking Garage Anomaly", "steam_appid": 3915010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every floor of this haunted garage carefully and see if you can find any anomalies. Getting it wrong will set you back to Floor 0, but if you manage to make it up to the 10th floor, you will find out what caused the garage to close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring over 30 unique anomaly levels, each floor loads a random challenge. Anomalies range from subtle details to jumpscares and explorable areas. Random events ensure a unique experience with each playthrough. No save points—every mistake sends you back to Floor 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you manage to reach floor 10?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every floor of this haunted garage carefully and see if you can find any anomalies. Getting it wrong will set you back to Floor 0, but if you manage to make it up to the 10th floor, you will find out what caused the garage to close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring over 30 unique anomaly levels, each floor loads a random challenge. Anomalies range from subtle details to jumpscares and explorable areas. Random events ensure a unique experience with each playthrough. No save points—every mistake sends you back to Floor 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you manage to reach floor 10?</p>", "short_description": "Explore a haunted parking garage in this first-person horror adventure. Uncover mysteries and anomalies as you progress through the floors. Reach the 10th floor to find out who or what has been haunting this place.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store